			"text":"|   |   |   |   |   |   |   |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n|**Step**|**Actor/System**|**Action**|**Input**|**Output**|**Manual/Automated**|**Evidence**|\n|1|Backend|Build toàn bộ OC population theo Company + Period|SalesRegister|OC population|Automated|Batch ID + timestamp|\n|2|DWH / WFX|Cung cấp Sales, COGS, OC và domain data|OC / period|Versioned snapshot|Automated|Lineage / refresh log|\n|3|Backend|Tính Reported Profitability|Sales + COGS|Reported Result|Automated|Calculation trace|\n|4|Rule Engine|Chạy Data Readiness Gate|Required data|PASS / DATA_INCOMPLETE|Automated|Rule Result|\n|5|Rule Engine|Phát hiện Candidate OC|Reported Result + configurable thresholds|Candidate flags|Automated|Rule ID / threshold version|\n|6|Backend|Dựng production timeline|Inventory Transaction By OC|Process/Factory/GDN/GRN timeline|Automated|Source transaction|\n|7|Rule Engine|Chạy Quantity, Material và OH rules|Domain datasets|Exceptions / reconciliation|Automated|Rule trace + evidence links|\n|8|Rule Engine|Chạy Subcontract và OC/Period rules|Production model + posting|Exception classification|Automated|Rule Result|\n|9|Rule Engine|Chạy Cost Completeness Gate|Missing/pending cost|PASS / COST_INCOMPLETE|Automated|Blocker list|\n|10|Backend|Tính Adjusted Result, BHQLDN và Final Margin|Approved corrections + allocation rate|Final Result|Automated|Calculation trace|\n|11|Rule Engine|So Plan và đề xuất Root Cause|Final Margin + Costing Margin|Root-cause suggestion|Automated suggestion|Variance evidence|\n|12|UI|Hiển thị Investigation Workspace|Investigation package|Reported/Adjusted/Final + evidence|Automated presentation|Data version|\n|13|Finance|Review và quyết định có cần correction|Rule result + evidence|Approve / Action Required / Escalate|Human decision|Review comment|\n|14|Exception Service|Giao owner, department, action và evidence|Finding|Exception Case|Automated workflow|Exception ID + audit|\n|15|Responsible Department|Sửa tại Source System|Exception Action|Corrected source|Manual|Correction reference|\n|16|DWH + Rule Engine|Refresh, rerun và compare before/after|Corrected source|Revalidation result|Automated|New snapshot + RuleRun|\n|17|Finance + Exception|Approve CLOSED hoặc giữ ACTION_REQUIRED / ESCALATED|Revalidation + evidence|Final status|Human approval|Audit Log|",
